 pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Negotiable</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not bought by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"consumable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Consumable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"regenseconds\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Regeneration</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0 seconds<br/><small>(0% full)</small></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.50<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 1, 2009<br/>Summer Update 2009</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20090620230128&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Carrot_Cake_fd0c0c.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a carrot cake.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 6.80 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">This spicy-sweet cake will probably put you into a sugar rush.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>Mmmm.</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>It will boost your Distance Fighting skill by 10 for one hour. If a <a href=\"#/wiki/Bullseye%20Potion\">Bullseye Potion</a> is used after you eat the cake, the skills from the cake are lost and you will only have the +5 skills from the Bullseye Potion, or if you die during the hour that you have the +10, the boost gets lost.\n</p><p>When using a Carrot Cake, Green Sparkles Effect <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Green Sparkles Effect\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Green_Sparkles_Effect_f26b9f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> will appear on the user who will get the following message: \"<span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">Your distance skill is improved for the next hour.</span>\"\n</p><p>To create this dish, you must speak with the <a href=\"#/wiki/Djinn\">Djinn</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/Jean%20Pierre\">Jean Pierre</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a>, near the Marid Fortress, during the Hot Cuisine event.\n</p><p><b>Necessary Ingredients:</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li>5 <a href=\"#/wiki/Carrot\">Carrots</a> <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Carrot\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Carrot_2667e2.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></li>\n<li>1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Vial\">Vial</a> of <a href=\"#/wiki/Milk\">Milk</a> <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Milk\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Milk_105cbe.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></li>\n<li>1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Lemon\">Lemon</a> <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Lemon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Lemon_8f1a93.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></li>\n<li>10 ounces of <a href=\"#/wiki/Flour\">Flour</a> <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Flour\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Flour_e828c3.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></li>\n<li>2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Egg\">Eggs</a> <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Egg\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Egg_e38eb8.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></li>\n<li>10 <a href=\"#/wiki/Cookie\">Cookies</a> <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Cookie\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cookie_af4426.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></li>\n<li>2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Peanut\">Peanuts</a> <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Peanut\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Peanut_cbd03f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></li></ul>\n<p>Only obtainable through the <a href=\"#/quest/hot-cuisine-quest\">Hot Cuisine Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bullseye%20Potion\">Bullseye Potion</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cake%20Keep%20Isle\">Cake Keep Isle</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Carrot\">Carrot</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cookie\">Cookie</a></li><li>Distance Fighting</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Egg\">Egg</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Flour\">Flour</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Food\">Food</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/hot-cuisine-quest\">Hot Cuisine Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lemon\">Lemon</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Milk\">Milk</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Peanut\">Peanut</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Vial\">Vial</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["hot-cuisine-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"hot-cuisine-quest","quest":"Hot Cuisine Quest","step":"2-9","n":16,"title":"Prato 10: Carrot Cake","kind":"reward","coords":[{"x":33068,"y":32531,"z":6,"label":"Jean Pierre"}]},{"slug":"hot-cuisine-quest","quest":"Hot Cuisine Quest","step":"4-0","n":24,"title":"Efeitos dos pratos","kind":"reward","coords":[]}]}}